  "details": "The best potential for fallbacks is to have fallback versions of non-fallback avatars, but the 10k tris and 1 material limit are too hard to hit even with baked textures.\nI have been using Cats Bake Function and no matter what I try it keeps destroying faces to hit 10k polys.  Since I can't have 2 materials I have no way to work around this manually with cats otherwise I could manage the face separately and merge at the end.\nWhen fallbacks avatars are trash and silly then people will still be showing avatars manually.  So the strict requirement is counter productive.  Also best case scenario for a fallback is to have a fallback variant of the player's main avatar.  With just a little more leadway people could be taught how to do this easily with blender and CATS.  Opportunity missed up till now for sure.  Please make adjustments I'm ready to promote custom fallbacks as soon as creating them is no longer a unicorn.",
